 "how_it_is_made": [
  "A nickel-plated steel strip is deep-drawn into a can; its closed end is formed into the + button.",
  "Cathode rings (manganese dioxide + graphite, black) are pressed into the can against its wall.",
  "A separator (non-woven paper) is set inside the rings as a cup.",
  "The anode - zinc powder in a potassium hydroxide gel (gray paste) - fills the separator.",
  "The current collector, a brass nail, is pushed through the nylon seal into the gel.",
  "The steel negative cap sits on the seal; the can's open edge is crimped over them, sealing the cell.",
  "A printed plastic sleeve is slid on and heat-shrunk, rolling over both shoulders."
